TITLE=Yomonsni - About - Who
BGIMAGE=yo-IMG_18620-5D-raw-shaped-flattened.jpg
SUBHEAD=Who is Yomonsni For?






      <div class="col-10">
	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-3">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Anyone?</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">While anyone can certainly enjoy the experience of a <a href="../massage/index.html">Yomonsni massage</a>, there are some personality and lifestyle traits that seem better able to really benefit from, and being right for the <a href="../development/index.html">Yomonsni development</a> process</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>


	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-3">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Well suited</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">You would be right for and likely benefit deeply from Yomonsni if you are: </p>
	    <ul>
	    <li>Open Minded. </li>
	    <li>Eager for personal change and development. Even better if you have some idea of the ways in which you want to develop.</li>
	    <li>Respectful</li>
	    <li>Posess a level of self discipline. While it can be developed through Yomonsi, starting with some helps.</li>
	    <li>Curious</li>
	    <li>Willing to trust the right people. There's no need to trust everyone, but if you can't trust your <a href="./glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a>, following their advice and accepting their help does not seem likely.</li>
	    <li>Patient</li>
	    <li>Committed</li>
	    <li>Believe that investing your time, energy and effort in yourself is a worthwhile investment</li>
	    <li>Willing to learn</li>
	    <li></li>
	    </ul>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
